{"id":"borracho","lemma":"borracho","pos":"adj","rank":1104,"glosses":["drunk, inebriated","boozy (containing alcohol)"],"ipa":"/boˈrat͡ʃo/","forms":{"feminine":"borracha","masculinePlural":"borrachos","femininePlural":"borrachas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/79/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-borracho.wav","examples":[{"text":"Yo no estaba borracho.","en":"I was not drunk.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/441674"},{"text":"Parece que ella está borracha.","en":"She looks as if she were drunk."},{"text":"Los dos estábamos borrachos.","en":"We were both drunk.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/821211"},{"text":"Está un poco borracho.","en":"He's a bit drunk.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/731664"},{"text":"Tom dijo que Mary parecía borracha.","en":"Tom said Mary seemed drunk."}]}